  "backup_desc": {
    "message": "Save your Apex AdBlocker settings to a JSON file and restore them later (e.g. after reinstalling). The file contains only disabled sites (domain names only) and My filters – the protection lists are fixed. Backups from older Apex AdBlocker versions can be imported too. It contains no history, statistics or diagnostic data. Nothing is sent anywhere."
  },
